        "t": "text",
        "v": "A business partner is anyone you buy from or sell to. Its roles say which: a supplier buys from you through a buy-from role and ships from a ship-from role, and a customer through sold-to and ship-to. Easy Entry makes the partner, its first address and those two roles in one go, from a defaults template."
      }
